{
  "title": { "zh": "拆帧", "en": "Unwrap the frame" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "从线上认出旗标之间的每一帧，去掉塞进的 0，逐个给出内容字节：一个字节收全的那一拍，「字节」给出它，「收到」为 1；结尾旗标收完的那一拍，「帧尾」为 1。其余各拍「字节」是「—」，「收到」和「帧尾」为 0。",
    "en": "Find each frame between flags on the wire, take out the stuffed 0s and give the content bytes one by one: on the tick a byte is complete, output it and make got 1; on the tick the closing flag is complete, make end 1. On every other tick the byte is 「—」 and got and end are 0."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"1-12\"></level-ref>送出的帧到了线的另一头：收的一方要认出旗标，把塞进的 0 去掉，再把位拼回字节。",
        "en": "Frames like those of <level-ref to=\"1-12\"></level-ref> reach the other end of the wire: the receiver has to spot the flags, take out the stuffed 0s and put the bits back into bytes."
      }
    }
  ],
  "wires": { "in": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "进线", "en": "Wire in" } }] },
  "outputs": [
    { "name": "byte", "label": { "zh": "字节", "en": "Byte" } },
    { "name": "got", "label": { "zh": "收到", "en": "Got" } },
    { "name": "end", "label": { "zh": "帧尾", "en": "End" } }
  ],
